{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨晩、「すべての犬は天国へ行く」観に行ったよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2015/10/07/0292900/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな役をモノにしてて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん笑ったしおそろしかったし惹きつけられました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お話の世界観がひん曲がってる感じも好きで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"面白かったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"殺し合いとか死と隣り合わせの緊張感があるのになぜか笑ってしまう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさにシリアス・コメディーでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わって会ったとき、まいちゅんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょうど去年虹プレを観ていつか自分も舞台出てみたいって思ったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いま立ってるから不思議って言ってて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとゆったんも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて観た舞台が虹プレで そこからハマったって言ってくれて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お客さんとして来たはずなのにすごく嬉しくなって帰っちゃいました(*ﾟｰﾟ)>"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は昨日みんなの舞台を観て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分も頑張らなきゃって思ったよーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、選抜みんなでMJ収録なんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6人のこと「わぁ、舞台に出てた人だぁ」って目で見ちゃう。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公演長いけど、あと半分"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"千秋楽までがんばってねー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして「リボンの騎士」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メインビジュアル公開されました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2015/10/07/0292900/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わぁーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガンバラネバ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「今、話したい誰かがいる」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MV公開されたよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言葉が話せない女の子をダンス部に誘ってコンクールを目指すのだけれど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本番当日、その子はニューヨークに行くことになってしまい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というストーリー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なーちゃんとまいやんの関係性や表情にキュンとしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2015/10/07/0292900/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなあさっての方を向いている。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このTシャツはなーちゃんデザイン。かわいぃ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影場所は、田んぼに囲まれた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2015/10/07/0292900/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イイトコー！！でしたっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2015/10/07/0292900/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょいちょい映り込んでる私の私服衣装"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかっぽいの～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"珍しい格好だか